  "status": "present",
  "value": "A set of games scored as in variant 1. The set is won at 6+ games with a 2-game lead; at 6-6 a tiebreak game is won at 7+ points with a 2-point lead, giving 7-6. Points after the set ends are ignored. getGameScore returns the current game text (variant 1 format), \"Tiebreak a-b\" during a tiebreak, or \"Set X\" after the set; getWinner returns the set winner or \"\".",
